      "title": "Collect the item's records and its cartons' records",
      "description": "### Collect the item's records and its cartons' records\n\n**DSA topic:** 6. Tree + DFS\n\nWhile an item was inside a carton, the carton's scans count for the item too. This collects one sorted list per container."
