      "title": "Merge them in time order with a heap",
      "description": "### Merge them in time order with a heap\n\n**DSA topic:** 9. Binary heap (priority queue)\n\n**k-way merge**: put the first record of each list in a min-**heap**, repeatedly take the earliest. O(N log k)."
    },
    {
      "file": "shared/dsa/heap.ts",
