        }
      },
      "title": "Proving the history was not changed",
      "description": "### Proving the history was not changed\n\n**DSA topic:** 4. Hash chain (linked list by hashes), 2. Digital signatures (Ed25519)\n\nWalk the chain from the first record: each `prev` must equal the previous hash, each hash must be recomputed exactly, and each signature must verify. O(k). The DSA page lets you tamper with a record and watch this fail."
    }
